        }
      ],
      "orig": "The map room occupies the quiet end of the neighborhood library. Its shelves hold folded street plans, ferry schedules, and hand-drawn routes collected over several decades. A small brass weight keeps each sheet flat while readers compare editions.",
      "text": "The map room occupies the quiet end of the neighborhood library. Its shelves hold folded street plans, ferry schedules, and hand-drawn routes collected over several decades. A small brass weight keeps each sheet flat while readers compare editions."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/2",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "bbox": {
            "l": 62.362206,
            "t": 681.39034,
            "r": 532.9133872099999,
            "b": 641.8446355704699,
            "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            231
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "Mara volunteers on Thursday afternoons. She records the paper's date, the names of its surveyors, and any handwritten notes near the margins. When a street changes, she adds a transparent overlay rather than altering the older map.",
      "text": "Mara volunteers on Thursday afternoons. She records the paper's date, the names of its surveyors, and any handwritten notes near the margins. When a street changes, she adds a transparent overlay rather than altering the older map."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/3",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "bbox": {
            "l": 62.362206,
            "t": 630.6363,
            "r": 532.9133871989997,
            "b": 591.0906755704699,
            "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            284
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "Visitors often arrive looking for one address and leave with a longer story. They discover a footbridge that no longer exists, a lane named after a vanished orchard, or a public stair hidden behind a market. The archive cannot answer every question, but it can show where to ask next.",
      "text": "Visitors often arrive looking for one address and leave with a longer story. They discover a footbridge that no longer exists, a lane named after a vanished orchard, or a public stair hidden behind a market. The archive cannot answer every question, but it can show where to ask next."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/4",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "bbox": {
